  "description": "we are a Christmas tree market, we have been based at this site since 2017, the setup consists of  temporary heras and crowd barrier fencing, with a mesh floor protection placed on the grass. there is a small 3m x 3m sales kiosk along with railway sleepers which hold the Christmas trees. there will be a scaffold area built 20m (L) x 3m (W) x 2m (H) which is there to hold the overstock of Christmas trees. There are 2 x netting machines to net the Christmas trees, there is power on site which powers the sales shed and the flood lights to illuminate the site, as well as festoon lighting around the perimeter. for staff welfare there will be a portal loo on site. ",
